OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fdrier and brighter this evening as
OL,7,Frain clears east. Winds are also
OL,8,Fexpected to ease which will allow for
OL,9,Fa chilly night with clear spells and a
OL,10,Frural grass frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FLargely dry on Monday with
OL,13,Flight winds and long sunny spells.
OL,14,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine. A
OL,15,Fsmall chance of the odd shower at
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
