OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTurning very wet and windy later on
OL,7,FTuesday with coastal gales. Rain
OL,8,Fclearing by Wednesday and Thursday to
OL,9,Fleave sunshine and showers with a
OL,10,Fstrong breeze.
